<h3>Performance calculation and reporting</h3>
<p>Alongside condition-based maintenance, we implement the calculations that show whether a plant is performing as designed:</p>
<ul>
<li>Boiler efficiency by direct and indirect method, for gas-fired and petroleum coke fired circulating fluidized bed boilers</li>
<li>Steam turbine efficiency and losses</li>
<li>Thermal balances and electrical energy balances</li>
<li>Process data collection from control systems and commercial metering units, with long-term archiving</li>
</ul>
<p>Control loop performance is monitored continuously, loops are retuned, and alternative control strategies are implemented where the existing one limits the unit.</p>
<p>In a typical&nbsp;plant setting, numerous controls and processes may not be functioning at their best, leading to inconsistent production, higher raw material usage, increased energy consumption, and reduced yields. Maintenance service from&nbsp;ISYSTEMS AUTOMATION offers PID tuning and process control systems tuning aimed at pinpointing the controls affecting performance and assisting you in achieving optimal production levels.</p></div></section><section class="section section--tint related-strip"><div class="container"><h3 class="related-strip__title">Related</h3><p class="related-strip__links"><a href="/service/process-automation.html">Process automation</a><span class="related-strip__sep" aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/service/process-optimization-advanced-process-control.html">Process optimization</a><span class="related-strip__sep" aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/service/manufacturing-execution-system.html">MES</a><span class="related-strip__sep" aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/service/safety-systems-burner-management-systems.html">Safety systems</a><span class="related-strip__sep" aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/service.html">All services</a></p></div></section>
